<title>USA: Chubb may set IPO for property arm - Barron's.</title>
<headline>Chubb may set IPO for property arm - Barron's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chubb Corp may be poised to offer its Bellemead Development Corp unit to the public via an initial public offering, Barron's said in its Jan 13 issue.</p>
<p>The financial weekly said Chubb has hired Goldman Sachs and Co to evaluate options with regard to its various business lines, including Bellemead, its property arm.</p>
<p>Bellemead's portfolio of properties is estimated to be worth $700 to $800 million, the paper said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
